[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3931438821","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116378#issuecomment-3931438821","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116378","id":3931438821,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qVP7l","user":{"login":"PureAsbestos","id":16106576,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTA2NTc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16106576?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos","html_url":"https://github.com/PureAsbestos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-20T03:46:54Z","updated_at":"2026-02-20T03:52:54Z","body":"Doesn't really make sense for this PR, but in the future we should probably add something like `command_render_set_depth_bias()` to RenderingDeviceDriver so that it can be set dynamically (e.g. with vkCmdSetDepthBias on Vulkan). Could be quite useful in the compositor.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3931438821/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3932288850","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116378#issuecomment-3932288850","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116378","id":3932288850,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qYfdS","user":{"login":"PureAsbestos","id":16106576,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTA2NTc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16106576?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos","html_url":"https://github.com/PureAsbestos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-20T08:05:19Z","updated_at":"2026-02-20T08:05:19Z","body":"Nearly ready for review. I just need to check that this behaves correctly on all platforms, at least for the depth bias itself. It's kind of hard to tell if clamping is working as it only really makes a difference in extreme scenarios.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3932288850/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3937364102","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116378#issuecomment-3937364102","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116378","id":3937364102,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qr2iG","user":{"login":"PureAsbestos","id":16106576,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTA2NTc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16106576?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos","html_url":"https://github.com/PureAsbestos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-20T22:01:32Z","updated_at":"2026-02-21T17:59:59Z","body":"It seems this works very differently on Metal, with the signs being flipped and needing much larger values. It works fine on MoltenVK, however, so this can probably be made consistent. WebGL, OpenGL, ANGLE, Vulkan, and D3D12 are all working as expected. Though I suspect D3D12 might possibly be interpreting the constant factor incorrectly.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, Android Vulkan does not seem to universally support VK_POLYGON_MODE_LINE, so wireframes are not rendered correctly. The depth bias is correctly applied though. Works perfectly with Compatibility. A fallback for generating wireframes on Vulkan might be in order? Out of the scope of this PR though.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3937364102/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3937446417","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116378#issuecomment-3937446417","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116378","id":3937446417,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qsKoR","user":{"login":"PureAsbestos","id":16106576,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTA2NTc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16106576?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos","html_url":"https://github.com/PureAsbestos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-20T22:26:22Z","updated_at":"2026-02-20T22:26:22Z","body":"Also, if we do start mixing and matching polygon modes and generated wireframes on Vulkan, we might as well do the same thing using glPolygonMode where available on Compatibility for performance... ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3937446417/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3938063985","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116378#issuecomment-3938063985","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116378","id":3938063985,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7quhZx","user":{"login":"PureAsbestos","id":16106576,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTA2NTc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16106576?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos","html_url":"https://github.com/PureAsbestos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-21T03:25:19Z","updated_at":"2026-02-21T03:25:19Z","body":"> It seems this works very differently on Metal, with the signs being flipped and needing much larger values\r\n\r\nI'm not sure what happened, but I am no longer able to replicate this behavior. I'm going to say this is good enough for review now.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3938063985/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3939389579","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116378#issuecomment-3939389579","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116378","id":3939389579,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qzlCL","user":{"login":"PureAsbestos","id":16106576,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTA2NTc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16106576?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos","html_url":"https://github.com/PureAsbestos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-21T20:29:02Z","updated_at":"2026-02-21T22:37:00Z","body":"The problem with using this to solve the z-fighting with collision shapes is that it really ought to be applied to the user's geometry, not the collision shape, because you can't consistently pull lines forward. It would solve the z-fighting of the triangles, but for the lines it would still look a little weird on e.g. Compatibility where we can't use a polygon mode for the wireframe. Not that we use it for any wireframe for collision shapes currently, apparently.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"805\" height=\"478\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c8dab717-2c80-45a1-93d4-9aeb751dbefe\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nit looks pretty good with MSAA though:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"831\" height=\"469\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cfd44005-bd6c-4fc6-a99f-f4882b5a3f47\" />\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3939389579/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3943890976","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116378#issuecomment-3943890976","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116378","id":3943890976,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7rEwAg","user":{"login":"blueskythlikesclouds","id":19259897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjU5ODk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19259897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds","html_url":"https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-23T10:25:55Z","updated_at":"2026-02-23T10:25:55Z","body":"> Doesn't really make sense for this PR, but in the future we should probably add something like command_render_set_depth_bias() to RenderingDeviceDriver so that it can be set dynamically (e.g. with vkCmdSetDepthBias on Vulkan). Could be quite useful in the compositor.\r\n\r\nNote that this should be an opt-in feature. D3D12 does not support dynamic depth bias without latest Agility SDK, and even with that, it may not work on older hardware.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3943890976/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3963760978","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116378#issuecomment-3963760978","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116378","id":3963760978,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7sQjFS","user":{"login":"PureAsbestos","id":16106576,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTA2NTc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16106576?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos","html_url":"https://github.com/PureAsbestos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureAsbestos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-26T03:35:42Z","updated_at":"2026-02-26T03:36:13Z","body":"> Note that this should be an opt-in feature. D3D12 does not support dynamic depth bias without latest Agility SDK, and even with that, it may not work on older hardware.\r\n\r\nThere is more information on dynamic depth bias state in D3D12 here: https://microsoft.github.io/DirectX-Specs/d3d/VulkanOn12.html#depth-bias-state\r\n\r\n\"Support for dynamic depth bias and index buffer strip cut is implied by, and must be supported on, drivers that report their DDI version to be 0099 or greater.\"","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3963760978/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4067734428","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116378#issuecomment-4067734428","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116378","id":4067734428,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ydLOc","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-16T13:38:30Z","updated_at":"2026-03-16T13:38:30Z","body":"Tested,